# Trimming the build context, on the same reasoning as the repository root's:
# anything in here that changes re-uploads the context and can invalidate a
# layer the build never reads.
#
# The Dockerfile COPYs five files by name rather than the directory, so nothing
# below could reach the image even without this. It is here so that the context
# for the one image whose selling point is having no dependencies does not
# quietly carry a test suite and a pile of bytecode.
tests/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
